The Dow is 9.7 percent down,

6
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,345
and the Nasdaq is down 13.5

7
00:00:10,145 --> 00:00:10,680
percent,

8
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,100
which puts it in what Wall

9
