Street calls a correction.

10
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,290
So is a crash coming?

11
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,270
Here's the short answer from history.

12
00:00:17,903 --> 00:00:19,103
Since 1950,

13
00:00:19,243 --> 00:00:20,873
the S&P 500 has fallen 8

14
00:00:20,673 --> 00:00:21,903
percent or more from a record

15
00:00:21,703 --> 00:00:22,823
37 times.

16
